## Diagnostic Commands (for future sessions)

```bash
# Check if page is actually loaded
curl -X POST http://camofox:9377/tabs/{tabId}/evaluate \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer $CAMOFOX_API_KEY" \
  -d '{"userId":"hermes","expression":"document.documentElement.outerHTML.length"}'

# Expected: >10000 for real page, ~124 for challenge page

# Check tab stats
curl "http://camofox:9377/tabs/{tabId}/stats?userId=hermes" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer $CAMOFOX_API_KEY"

# Screenshot comparison
# Real page: ~30-50KB | Blocked: ~15KB solid color
```

