## Key Takeaway

**Camofox works perfectly for normal sites** (verified with `example.com`). The blank page is **not a Camofox bug** — it's LinkedIn serving a challenge page that headless browsers can't render. The 124-char HTML is likely a JavaScript challenge or meta-refresh that requires full JS execution + browser fingerprint matching.